@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - AI Football Match Analyst

actor User
participant Website
participant "Flask API" as API
participant Validation
participant AIAnalyzer
participant Report
participant "Human Review" as Review

User -> Website: Enter match data
Website -> API: POST /api/analyse
API -> Validation: Check required fields
Validation --> API: Validation result

alt valid data
    API -> AIAnalyzer: Analyse match data
    AIAnalyzer -> Report: Generate structured report
    Report --> AIAnalyzer: Report object
    AIAnalyzer --> API: Analysis result
    API --> Website: Return JSON report
    Website -> Review: Display report for human review
else missing fields
    API --> Website: Return 400 error
end

@enduml
